{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22124","headline":"秋山 · 白居易","name":"秋山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久病旷心赏，今朝一登山。\n山秋云物冷，称我清羸颜。\n白石卧可枕，青萝行可攀。\n意中如有得，尽日不欲还。\n人生无几何，如寄天地间。\n心有千载忧，身无一日闲。\n何时解尘网，此地来掩关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}